<DownloadLayout platform="macos" title="macOS" description="Separate downloads for Apple silicon and Intel Macs. Check Apple menu → About This Mac before choosing.">
  <h2>Install on macOS</h2><ol><li>Choose the DMG that matches your processor.</li><li>Open the DMG and move Refract to Applications.</li><li>Open Refract from Applications.</li></ol>
  <h3>Unsigned builds</h3><p>The current macOS builds are unsigned. If macOS blocks the first launch, verify that your installer came from the official Refract GitHub release. Follow <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/102445">Apple's guidance for opening an app from an unidentified developer</a>.</p>
  <p>Do not disable Gatekeeper globally. If you are unsure about a warning, ask for help in the <a href="https://discord.gg/tE8s5VaWmS">Refract Discord</a>.</p>
</DownloadLayout>
